Z||000011||fropuff||09-26-2001||11:54 PM||||Thanks.  I hope I win too.  Right now, I'm trying to figure out what to bring with me.  I'm having the ICO manager write down some stuff.  The other guy claimed that I was trying to squeeze by him, and I'm having the manager write down where the cars were parked when he came out.  It makes no sense anyway.  Where the damage is, I'd have to be doing an e-brake turn to clip him with the rear and hit him in the front of his rear wheels.  Whatever.  Thanks again.<p>[This message has been edited by fropuff (edited 09-26-2001).]||||reg||1
